OL,3,GNEWSAHorse rescued from muddy bog by
OL,4,Afirefighters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse that became stuck in a muddy
OL,7,Fbog has been freed by firefighters.
OL,9,FCrews were called to the animal rescue
OL,10,Fon Northill Road in Cople, near
OL,11,FBedford, on Thursday.
OL,13,FFirefighters from Biggleswade, Bedford
OL,14,Fand Kempston fire stations used
OL,15,Fspecialist animal rescue equipment to
OL,16,Ffree the horse.
OL,18,FIt is the second incident of a horse
OL,19,Frescue in a week after fire crews were
OL,20,Fcalled to a similar incident in Wilden
OL,21,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
